theorem k215UnpairAt2858CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt2858State k215PNum2858 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt2858State k215PNum2858 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt2858Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt2858Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt2858Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt2858ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt2858Reach16))));
